window.products.push({"id":734089,"name":"Waterdrop Chubby 10-Cup Water Filter Pitcher& Replacement Alkaline Filters","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jji8QbHbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Healthy alkaline water: Alkaline water is one of the latest health trends. Alkaline water helps slow down the aging process and regulate the pH value of your body. It can also help avert various chronic diseases. Waterdrop alkaline and mineral filter contains mineral material, and the pH level can be increased to 8.0-9.5. You can drink alkaline water at home and stay healthy. Effective filtration: Using 7-stage water filter technology, Waterdrop Chubby water filter pitcher tests water to eliminate as many impurities as possible. It can reduce fluoride, chlorine, taste and odor, and heavy metals such as aluminum, iron, copper, and mercury, tested by a third lab. At the same time, it adds zinc, calcium, magnesium, selenium, lithium, iodine, and other minerals and trace elements to your water. Drink more water every day with Waterdrop. Ultra-high absorptive material: The filter employs carefully selected materials with advanced ACF (activated carbon fiber) technology. Its absorption capacity is 10 times higher than that of ordinary filters. The application of the latest Japanese technology assures you of the filter’s high quality and stellar user experience. NSF certified filtration performance: This filter water pitcher has passed NSF42 and 372 certifications, confirming the use of high-quality carbon fiber only. The residual chlorine reduction rate is as high as 97.4%, and the Waterdrop pitcher effectively reduces odor, iron, and metal ions like calcium, magnesium, mercury, copper and other substances according to third-party testing while improving the overall taste. Intelligent indicator: Our Intelligent design of the water filter pitcher ensures a healthier and hassle-free life for users, as you can monitor water quality at any time. Thanks to the replaceable intelligent indicator which can sense when water is being poured, you can now see the usage state of the filter element based on the display mode of the LED (light-emitting diode) in real time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jji8QbHbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WATERDROP","source_asin":"B0B3MDRJXG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-734089","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3MDRJXG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3MDRJXG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
