window.products.push({"id":734185,"name":"Mattress Pads, Twin XL Mattress Pad, New Upgraded Checkered, Super Soft, and Noiseless Mattress Cover, Breathable Cooling Mattress Protector, with 21 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VxgvH-EJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Microfiber Cover Polyester Fiber Fill ⭐Soft and Fluffy Mattress Pads⭐: Twin XL mattress pad (39''x80'') with a superfine fiber top layer and a newly designed polyester fiber fill, providing softness and extra elasticity, giving you a comfortable feeling and the most relaxing Sleep. ⭐Breathable and Cool Mattress Cover⭐: The superfine fiber top with sanding technology makes the surface feel cool, breathable, and skin-friendly, and the polyester fiber fill increases circulation and breathability. It will provide you with a comfortable and breathable sleeping environment, allowing you to feel comfortable without worrying about sweating and stuffiness. ⭐Upgraded Stitched Mattress Pads⭐: Compared with ordinary square quilted seams, this new style quilted body pad is more supportive, soft, and durable. It rebounds well after washing, is not easy to foam and agglomerate, and has quick-drying and anti-wrinkle functions to help save your time and electricity bills. ⭐Mattresses with 8''-21''Deep Mattress Protector⭐: The sides of the 360° fabric pockets can be easily stretched to fit mattresses up to 8 inches -21 inches thick. It can fit all types of mattresses, whether it is a normal mattress, a water bed, or a memory mattress. No matter how you twist and turn on the bed, it will not slip. ⭐Machine Washable Mattress Pad⭐: Machine washable and dry at low temperature under the gentle circulation of cold water. Please do not dry clean. ⭐Tip⭐: As the mattress pad is vacuum-packed and transported, you can open it and let it rest for 48 hours to make it fluffy before use, or you can choose to iron it at a low temperature to make it recover faster.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VxgvH-EJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SLIGUY","source_asin":"B09L44CV9X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-734185","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09L44CV9X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09L44CV9X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":734186,"name":"Ivy Lane Design with Chain Gingham Bow Tie, Navy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.48,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611XC4Rc2GL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"A beautiful pre-tied Navy gingham bowtie on a gold chain. Formal has never been so easy! measures 2 inch H x 4 inch W (Bow); 15 inch (chain). please note that due to inherent variations in the manufacturing process and differences in your monitor's color settings, the appearance of this item may vary slightly from the item pictured. Ivy Lane Design wedding accessories are perfect for the planner looking for quality and value while keeping things within budget. Assembled in the USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611XC4Rc2GL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ivy Lane Design","source_asin":"B0743QJDDD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-734186","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0743QJDDD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0743QJDDD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":734187,"name":"Renegade Blade 4pk-10-80t Razor/Hybrid - Combo Specialty - Carbide Brush Cutter Weed Eater Blades, 254mm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dz0+cyPJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"(1)---UNIVERSAL FIT -- each of our blades will fit either 25.4mm Arbor (same as 1”) or a 20mm Arbor with included “reducer washer” with YOUR \"Blade Hardware\". (2)--- IMPORTANT |BLADE HARDWARE: A Blade will {not} fit onto the Trimmer Axel Shaft by itself like the String Line Dispenser Spool will, so you must acquire \"Blade Hardware\" (mounting adapter kit or parts) that consists typically of two small discs; one has a raised circle on it that the blade hole (arbor) fits onto, the 2nd small disc is the cap disc, then screw on the Nut and apply a Cotter Pin. Sorry, we DO NOT supply blade hardware. (3)--- CARBIDE MIX in our teeth is proprietary and 2nd to none. Just Tungsten is not enough; additives like: Hafnium, Tantalum, Titanium, Molybdenum, Silicone, Zirconium, Boron, Niobium, Chromium, & Vanadium, make for a better Carbide Mix for longer lasting teeth. (4)--- ULTRA HIGH RPM: Our blade is built for any RPM even super high RPM Trimmers (10,000+ rpm). Manufactured with a more flexible steel as compared to the much more brittle steel found with table saw blades (table saw blades can shatter if they hit an obstacle, plus they are only built for approx. 3,450 rpm so they should never be used with gasoline powered Garden Trimmers. (5)--- RENEGADE BLADE is the ONLY Carbide Brush Blade BRAND on AMAZON that has a {REPORT} from the foremost Testing Laboratory: UL, LLC. (6)--- CHOOSING THE CORRECT BLADE: Blades line up on a polarity scale with maximum TEETH on one end [for CUT] all the way to maximum CAVITIES [for GRAB] on the other end. EXAMPLE: Wood tree limbs require more teeth and no cavities, and wispy flexible brush or grass requires maximum grab as teeth alone just pushes grass over without cutting. THEREFORE: You must pick a {Teeth & Cavity Pattern} that best suits your material being cut. We offer blades to handle any: Wood, Bushes, Brambles, Hedging, Brush & Grass.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dz0+cyPJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Renegade Blade","source_asin":"B01B01M0GY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-734187","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01B01M0GY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01B01M0GY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
