window.products.push({"id":734286,"name":"6.5' Pre-Lit Twin Lakes Fir Artificial Christmas Tree - Warm White LED Lights","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":232.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81R+6NQO8jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Create that perfect holiday focal point in your home with our beautiful Twin Lakes Fir artificial Christmas tree. This tree was carefully designed with PVC branches giving it that traditional look and feel. This pre-lit tree with warm clear LED lights takes the hassle out of sorting through those tangled lights and putting them on the tree. Let this easy to set up tree be the perfect Christmas decoration in your home. Product Features:. Pre-lit with 300 warm white LED lights. \"Warm white\" also known as \"warm clear\" has a soft natural incandescent glow, similar to candlelight. Bulb size: micro wide angle. 900 tips. 2\" wide tapered tips. 7' green lead cord. Full profile tree. Hinged branch construction Additional Product Features:. LED lights use 90% less energy. Bulbs stay cool to the touch. Light sets on tree are UL certified and approved for indoor or outdoor use, however, the tree itself is recommended for indoor use only. If one bulb burns out, the rest will stay lit. Non-replaceable bulbs. 4-piece easy assembly (including stand). Comes with a black metal tree stand. Wire gauge: 22 Dimensions: 6.5' high (from the base of the stand to the top of the tree). 46\" base diameter (at the widest point) Material(s): PVC/metal/plastic bulbs/wireNote: Branches are compressed for shipment, and need to be fluffed out upon arrival to look like the photo.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81R+6NQO8jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Northlight","source_asin":"B07WWYFLJG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-734286","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WWYFLJG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WWYFLJG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
