window.products.push({"id":734376,"name":"3pcs Dough Blender Set, Pastry Cutter Stainless Steel, Pastry Scraper & Biscuit Cutter Professional Heavy-Duty Baking Dough Tools with Ergonomic Soft ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Sdx4PNEJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you searching for something that will help you to mash potatoes, make sauces or cut items without wasting so much time and effort? Tired of mashing the coldest butter into the flour using a fork and knife? Need something safe and durable that you can easily hold without being heavy? If your answer is YES, then STOP SEARCHING because this set of 3 pieces is just what you need for your baking needs! Great Quality – Precise dough cutting is now easier than ever. Made from heavy-duty stainless-steel material that it won't rust, designed to last for years to come. Just What You Need - A grueling and time-consuming task that's can now be handle by our dough blender. Not only will this blender work its magic with pastry but can also be used as a tool for mashing and blending other food items such as potatoes, avocado, meats, or eggs, while the scraper with measure guide and inch-marking scale makes it easier to cut through and a section of your dough as well as retrieve it from various surfaces. It also serves a dual purpose by giving you the capability to chop through nuts, chocolate, fruit, etc. Ergonomic Design – Say goodbye to the sore hands and wrists, because these baking dough tools are designed with a soft and easy-grip handle that won't spin or come loose in your hand, and it will keep your fingers safe and your wrist comfortable while you're cutting. Dishwasher Safe – Clean them with warm water and mild detergent, or put them in your dishwasher machine. It’s that simple! PACKAGE INCLUDES: 1 x Dough Blender 1 x Pastry Scraper 1 x Biscuit Cutter Set Notes: The clamp that comes along with the cutter helps to keep all 5 cutters together when not in use, making for easy storage. The biscuit/cookie cutter comes in 5 different sizes (4,5,6,7,8 cm) Our mission is to give you 100% satisfaction, so don't wait and ORDER NOW!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Sdx4PNEJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bstep","source_asin":"B088NTBST7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-734376","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088NTBST7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088NTBST7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
