window.products.push({"id":734385,"name":"Amco 3 in 1 Banana Split Tool","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4142HykjagL._AC_.jpg","description":"Amco houseworks, an award-winning brand, has been making cooking and cleaning easier since the 1970's. It's a commitment that's earned it the love and respect of professional and home cooks around the world. Amco houseworks creates quality, innovative, stylishly designed kitchen tools and accessories that help people enhance the quality of their cooking and entertaining.  Amco houseworks uses commercial grade stainless steel to craft its top quality kitchen utensils and accessories. We specialize in combining precision and performance to create stylishly designed premium kitchen tools. Our products are innovative, are intuitive and easy to use for the cooking enthusiast.  Use this amco 3 in 1 tool to slice and split bananas. It also features a serrated edge for starting soft bananas at their stem. The wire edge splits bananas in half and the tool cuts bananas up to 20 even slices. This item is dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4142HykjagL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amco","source_asin":"B008DSI89Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-734385","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008DSI89Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008DSI89Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":734386,"name":"BrüMate Shaker, 20oz Triple-Insulated Stainless Steel Cocktail Shaker (Aqua)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YQSfsCWwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SHAKER & TUMBLER, ALL IN ONE: Our Shaker series is not only the coolest cocktail shaker you've ever seen, it's also compatible with our Imperial Pint Müv lid and works as a 20oz glass so you can drink your perfect cocktail right from the source! LEAK-PROOF TOP: Tired of messy shakers? Us too. Our patent-pending, leak-proof top allows you to craft the perfect cocktail without the mess of a normal shaker. BEVGUARD TECHNOLOGY: Our BevGuard technology guarantees your drinks stay ice-cold and refreshing, without the metallic aftertaste other stainless steel products often have. So sip back and relax, because drinks are better with BrüMate. MAKE IT YOUR OWN: Our shaker top is compatible with all of our 20oz Imperial Pint series tumblers so you can collect them all and always have the perfect match, no matter the occasion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YQSfsCWwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BrüMate","source_asin":"B0BJZVVVSD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-734386","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJZVVVSD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJZVVVSD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":734387,"name":"Acacia Wood Ukulele Dish 7 x 3.5 x 1 inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FKC+4B-hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These skillfully handcrafted woodenware showcase the rich contrasts of color and grain that in intrinsic in eco-friendly Acacia Wood. Acacia Wood is fast growing an non-endangered. Our Acacia woodenware is a combination of function and form, which also adds an artistic flair to any table setting. High-quality, durable, and food safe. Hand wash with soap and water. Put nature’s beauty on display. Each piece is a true work of art.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FKC+4B-hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Island Home","source_asin":"B01B22KUIQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-734387","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01B22KUIQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01B22KUIQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":734388,"name":"Department56 Enesco The World of Miss Mindy Alice in Wonderland Figurine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Io+-2V-oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Alice from Walt Disney’s “Alice in Wonderland” gives a sweet, wide-eyed look upward as she sits on a mushroom. Hand-painted in fun colors and exquisite detail, the charms of this handcrafted stone resin figurine never fail.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Io+-2V-oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department56","source_asin":"B078SL1XWS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-734388","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078SL1XWS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078SL1XWS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":734389,"name":"Karoto 2 Bundle Includes - 1 Karoto + 1 Karoto Julienne/Roots and Vegetable Peeler Kit for Salads/Peels, Strips, Sharpens & Curls veggies - from a Ser","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uOBsbHzGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MAKE YOUR VEGGIES BEAUTIFUL with this Karoto & Karoto Julienne Combo - an easy way to surprise your family and guests - garnish sharpish ! These peelers are amazingly simple gadgets that will nonetheless save the day in your kitchen. KAROTO (thats the yellow sharpener) is essentially a carrot peeler (or a potato peeler; in fact, you can use it on lots of vegetables, like zucchinis, eggplants, and beets) it also has a sharpener-like blade making it a vegetable ribbon peeler: turn the veggies into fantastical curls that you can then add to soups or salads or decorate dishes with. KAROTO JULIENNE (thats the blue sharpener) has the same function of sharpening, however the peeler blade has been replaced with a Julienne blade to create noodle-like strips from firm roots and veggies. CHOOSE THE BEST VEGETABLE PEELER. These multifunctional vegetable peelers / curlers / ribbon or strips makers can be used not only to peel your vegetables (use Karoto with a straight peeler blade) but also to cut them into paper-thin slices that you can then cook or use to throw together a healthy raw veggie salad within just a few minutes. Use the peeler as a cutting tool occasionally, and see how these carrot peelers expand the horizons of preparing and serving your vegetables. RELIABLE MATERIALS. These are durable metal vegetable peelers in a plastic frame, and it’s not just, say, a cucumber peeler, but it’s also fit for tougher veggies: it will easily handle the potato peeler’s job and even work as a ginger peeler. It will cope with soft and watery vegetables as well as it will with hard ones like radishes or purple sweet potatoes. The peeler’s materials are also food grade, BPA-free, and dishwasher-safe: healthy and convenient! FOCUS ON FUN & FUNCTIONALITY. We at Monkey Business like to design unique kitchen gadgets that will liven up your kitchen, diversify your culinary repertoire, and make cooking more fun. We develop cute kitchen stuff and funny kitchen gadgets (because it’s amazing how those simple things can make their owners and their owners’ dinner guests smile), but we never compromise functionality: our practical and cool gadgets can become your handy assistants. MAKES A PERFECT GIFT. A cute and original kitchen peeler makes a humble yet charming gift for anyone who likes to cook and doesn’t mind experimenting with their kitchen paraphernalia. Developed by local designers, Monkey Business cool cooking gadgets have won international industrial design awards for delivering clever and imaginative solutions. These vegetable peelers / curlers / rose makers will surely be appreciated by foodies among your friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uOBsbHzGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Monkey Business","source_asin":"B077H528WP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-734389","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077H528WP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077H528WP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
