window.products.push({"id":734396,"name":"Sweet Water Decor Cute Coffee Mugs with Golden Handle, 16oz China Coffee Cup with Motivational Quote, Embellished with Real Gold & Microwave Safe, Ins","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51OnIDjdamL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"DETAILS - 16oz fine bone china, 4 3/4\" x 3 7/8\" (5 5/8\" w/handle). Handlettered design on both sides of the mug. Hand washing is recommended to preserve the microwave-safe gold finish. Avoid abrasive cloths when cleaning. Use caution when removing mug from the microwave. If sparks occur or the handle becomes too hot, discontinue using in the microwave. Designed in the USA, imported. CUTE COFFEE MUGS - Our 16 fl. oz Coffee Mug will enhance your coffee drinking experience with its chic stylish design. Each mug features a real gold embellished handle and hand drawn quote design on both sides. These elegant and cute mugs offer an empowering uplifting affirmation to the start of your day. This cup will also make a fun tea mug if you are not a coffee drinker. MICROWAVE SAFE COFFEE CUP - Each and every coffee mug is made from lead free fine bone china. They are perfect for warming up liquids in the microwave, like soup, milk, hot chocolate, cider, coffee or tea. Because of the hand drawn designs, we recommend hand washing these mugs and not placing them in the dishwasher. Replace your boring white coffee mugs with our women centric motivational and inspirational coffee mugs. FOR HOME AND OFFICE USE - Our coffee accessories are designed to keep you motivated at home and during a hard day at the office. If you are looking for cute and inspiring decoration pieces, our cups can also be used for storing small items around the home and office. Our coffee mugs are designed to inspire all women to go out and live their dreams. Try our mug today and bring out boss lady you were meant to be! TEA & COFFEE GIFT FOR WOMEN - This elegant mug will make a great addition to any gift set. The handmade eyelashes design is elegant and timeless, making it the perfect coffee gifts for her, any time of the year. If you are looking for birthday gifts for women, best friend gifts, mothers day gifts, housewarming gifts, friendship gifts for women, girlfriend gifts or sister gifts look no further.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51OnIDjdamL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sweet Water Decor","source_asin":"B09GL23ND7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-734396","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GL23ND7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GL23ND7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":734397,"name":"LITO Linen And Towel Cheesecloth | 100% Unbleached Organic Cotton Muslin Cloth| Pastry Cloth, Cheese Cloth For Straining, Filtering Sauces & Nut Milk|","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718vD2h21GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Linen And Towel Cheesecloth - 100% Unbleached Organic Cotton 2 Pack 36 Sq Ft Grade 90 Natural Color Cheese Cloths for Straining, Pastry Cloth, Organic Cheese Cloth, Bouquet Filter Sauces & Nut Milk. Premium organic cheese cloth meets the highest kitchen stAndards. When using cheesecloth for straining you don’t have to worry about the left over chemicals leaching out of the cheese cloth And into your food, cooking or skin. Grade 90 is a high grade And best quality in cheese cloth. More impurities will be filtered out. Grade 90 cheesecloth is a high quality And this cheesecloth can be washed And reused, unlike other cheese cloth brands And substitutes which just for one-time use. The cheesecloth is 1 yards (36 in) wide And 4 yards (144 in) long with no pre-cut. Ready to be trimmed according to how much you need, to use as strainer, spice bag, bouquet or nut milk bag, And its washable And reusable. The cheesecloth can be used in a great number of different household And professional applications. Spice bags, canning, kombucha scoby, cheese, yoghurt And wine making, keeping chicken or fish intact when poaching, roasting turkey or chicken, squeezing citrus juice without seeds, fine surface polishing, staining, cleaning, dusting, Halloween decoration, ghost-making. Cheese cloths for straining are a washable And reusable strainer. Cheesecloth can be used for industrial purposes as well in paint shops, automotive shops, as well as bakeries, commercial kitchens and restaurants.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718vD2h21GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LITO LINEN AND TOWEL","source_asin":"B0BFXLHZ6Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-734397","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFXLHZ6Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFXLHZ6Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
