window.products.push({"id":734408,"name":"suddus Curtain Lights for Bedroom, 200 Led Hanging String Lights Outdoor Waterproof, Fairy Curtain Lights for Backdrop, Window, Wall, Wedding, Party, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SSATX4hTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[8 LIGHTING MODE/ TIMER] Steady on and 7 flashing modes: Combination, in waves, sequential, slo-glo, chasing/ flash, slow fade, and twinkle/ flash. The timer will keep the fairy lights turned on for 6 hours, with an 18-hour off every 24 hours. You can press the timer button for over 3 seconds to turn on/ off the timer function (lights flash twice means the timer is on/ flash once means the timer is off). [REMOTE CONTROL/ MEMORY FUNCTION] There are 8 buttons corresponding to 8 modes on the remote. You can control the string lights indoors within 72 feet. (Note that you'd better aim the remote control at USB.) The remote also saves the last mode and brightness you choose automatically. So you don’t need to reset them next time. [CURTAIN LIGHTS USB] Plugging in the USB is more convenient than the electrical socket especially when you are outdoors. You can plug it into a power bank, a laptop, etc. The instant you plug in, the bedroom fairy lights turn on. Then press the button on the USB to switch the mode. Once pull the plug out, every function should reset next time. [SIZE] The 200 led hanging fairy lights have 10 strings. Each string has 20 led bulbs. The length of extension cord is 9.8 feet. The curtain lights size is 6.5 ft*6.5 ft. [IP44 WATERPROOF/ SAFETY] The IP44 waterproof grade is adequate protection against rain and snow, which does not affect the outdoor waterfall lights. (Note that the USB is not waterproof.) Fairy lights and the USB will always keep a low temperature. It’s 100% safe to touch them. [PERFECT FOR DECORATION] Strings, USB and the extension cord are transparent and clear. Perfect for indoor and outdoor decoration as well as Christmas, Valentine's Day, Holiday, wedding, party, bedroom, living room, garden, etc. Decorate your home this Christmas, you will receive compliments from your neighbors and friends! [ADJUSTABLE BRIGHTNESS] There are two buttons on the remote control to adjust the brightness. Different light make you feel different. Bright light is suitable for a party. Dim light is suitable for rest. [SATISFACTION GUARANTEE] The waterfall lights come with 30-day free exchange service and 12-month warranty. And we will be 24/7 online. If you have any questions about this product, please feel free to contact our customer service, we will solve problems for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SSATX4hTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"suddus","source_asin":"B08LZ6JJ78","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-734408","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LZ6JJ78","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LZ6JJ78","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
