window.products.push({"id":734415,"name":"Welcome Home Brands Large Cake Baking Pans, Set of 3, Christmas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mpaFWIkAL._AC_.jpg","description":"Holidays are traditional times for baking and gift-giving, and Welcome Home Brands has the perfect solution for both. Delicious desserts and savory cakes are served in style when baked in Welcome Home Brands decorative paper bakeware. These pans and cups are the ultimate in baking convenience. No pre-greasing necessary-they are disposable for an easy, mess-free clean up. Oven safe to 400 degrees Fahrenheit and freezer safe, these pans couldn't be simpler to use; pour batter directly into the pan, bake and serve or freeze Pans can be placed directly on the oven rack while cups can be placed on a cookie-sheet for easy transport in and out of the oven. Paper bakeware is a growing trend because it makes baking easier, faster and more fun Welcome Home Brand's award-winning oven-safe paper baking pans and cups come in a variety of patterns, sizes and shapes to fit any occasion. The perfect gift-giving or pot-luck solution-there is no need to take the pan home Simply tear away the paper and recycle… it couldn't be easier. Don't bake? The vast array of styles sizes and patterns make these cups/pans great serving dishes for candy or nuts. Party-planners will adore their use as party-favor holders, or for wedding favors. The possibilities are endless Whether your style is sophisticated or whimsical, traditional or modern, Welcome Home Brands has a pattern to fit your mood occasion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mpaFWIkAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Welcome Home Brands","source_asin":"B007XEH892","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-734415","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007XEH892","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007XEH892","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
