window.products.push({"id":734506,"name":"Lantana Chef Knife Sharpener, Soft Grip 3-Stage Professional Knife Sharpening System (for Ceramic and Steel Knives of All Sizes), Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-n3nWQwdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Lantana Chef Professional Knife Sharpener with revolutionary 3-stage sharpening system will keep your ceramic and steel knifes constantly sharp. No more guesswork on how to sharpen your knives. Easy operation: Simply run your dull steel knife about 3 or 4 times through the \"coarse\" slot by pulling the knife towards you, and twice through the \"fine\" slot to remove burrs, and enjoy a perfectly sharpened knife in seconds!!! The ceramic slot can be used to hone a ceramic knife to hairsplitting sharpness. Keep it next to your cutting board and enjoy sharp knives for slicing your favorite meats, vegetables, fruits, etc. // NOTE: * This product was designed for straight-edged knives only. Do not use on scissors or serrated knives. * Do not pull knife back and forth. Knife should only be sharpened by running it through the slot from heel to its point.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-n3nWQwdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lantana Chef","source_asin":"B017X5WO3K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-734506","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017X5WO3K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017X5WO3K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":734507,"name":"Cardona Electric Fireplace - Walnut","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":611.92,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91oMiJjFgjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A beautiful Victorian design and faux marble combine to create this timeless design; add the beauty and romance of a glowing fire and you have a versatile electric fireplace that will complement any room in your home. This walnut finish fireplace features traditional pilaster wood corbels, an intricate center medallion, and luxurious faux marble. The firebox has realistic, multicolor flickering flames and glowing embers with an interior brick design for a more lifelike look. This transitional fireplace is great for the living room and bedroom, and even adds a warm touch to the dining room or home office. This electric fireplace features energy efficient LED and requires no professional installation, making it a cost effective way to upgrade your living or media room. LED lights also offer optional down light illumination. Easy to use remote control offers 4-way adjustability to warm the room conveniently. Remote control adjusts thermostat, timer, logs, and flames separately. Safety features include automatic shutoff and glass that remains cool to the touch (safe, self-regulating heater turns off when desired temperature is met). Once powered off, logs and flames slowly turn down. Turn off the heat to enjoy the fireplace ambience year round! This wonderful piece offers supplemental heat for up to 400 square feet. Accommodates a flat panel TV up to 43.25\" W overall and conveniently plugs into a standard wall outlet a with 6' cord. Specifications: Temperature ratings: 62-82 degrees at 4 degree intervals; Heating/power: 120V/60Hz, 1500W, 12.5 Amps; Batteries: 1 CR2025, included. Dimension include: Overall: 45.25\" W x 15.5\" D x 40\" H; Firebox front: 23\" W x 20\" H. This one-of-a-kind item approximately weighs 127 pounds and can support up to 75 pounds (mantel). Only quality materials and manufacturing will do. Product materials include: pine, MDF, particle board, pine veneer, metal, glass, resin. Assembly: Required. Made in China.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91oMiJjFgjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Furniture HotSpot","source_asin":"B08L7SZNF9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-734507","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L7SZNF9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L7SZNF9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
