window.products.push({"id":734630,"name":"Laguiole Made in France Le Theirs Premium Straight Edge Sharp Full Tang Stainless Steel 6-Piece Steak Knife Set, Olive Wood Handles by Roger Orfevre","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":149.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8169E4pP35L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DURABLE. Laguiole steak knives are made in France using heavy duty stainless steel so you can expect quality and durability in our knives. The full tang blade is attached with 3 rivets ensuring the durability you want in a steak knife. SHARP. Straight edge blade is razor sharp and cuts through steaks, lamb chops, and meats without added pressure, thus retaining its flavorful juices. The blade has the ability to be sharpened extending the lifetime of your knife! BEAUTIFUL. This 6 piece set contains beautiful olive wood handles. Olive wood is know for its beautiful grain texture, strength and durability. MADE IN FRANCE. Located in Thiers, the company ROGER ORFEVRE is specialized in cutlery, the manufacture of wooden articles, Tableware and gifts. Since 1924, it has combined a long experience in shaping wood and working with stainless steel. It thus offers a wide range of references in the art of hosting. Roger Orfèvre passes on from generation to generation, its know-how and knowledge to create and manufacture quality articles. WARRANTY. Lifetime warranty against manufacturer defects only. Clermont Coutellerie will not repair or replace items that show obvious signs of neglect or intentional damages resulting from the inability to use the steak knife as it was intended.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8169E4pP35L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ROGER ORFEVRE","source_asin":"B08DPYC5K7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-734630","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DPYC5K7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DPYC5K7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":734631,"name":"Small Round Tip Flower Stamen (Olive Green) by World of Sugar Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qb2M8qLUL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Scott Clark Woolley’s flower stamen collection from the magical \"World of Sugar Art” (WSA). These are the finest artificial flower stamens made in the world! The Japanese have always proven to be experts at the creation of natural beauty in any art form. With tiny delicacy, they have again shown that to be true with this series of flower stamens. Add sophistication to your sculpted flowers with botanically-specific stamens in a multitude of colors, types and sizes! Collect up a variety of sorts, so that when you are ready to create, you have at hand the proper botanical part to make a lifelike flower!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qb2M8qLUL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"W OF S A SCOTT CLARK WOOLLEY","source_asin":"B071ZNQGWJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-734631","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071ZNQGWJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071ZNQGWJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
