window.products.push({"id":734633,"name":"Classic Brands 3-Inch Cool Cloud Gel Memory Foam Mattress Topper With Free Cover, California King","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Np1qiFwwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy the luxurious benefits of the Classic Brands 3-Inch Ventilated Gel Memory Foam Mattress Topper without having to buy a brand-new mattress. Get a comfortable night's sleep by adding the ventilated designed topper that increases airflow and reduces body heat. And no more tossing and turning through the night, this topper conforms to the contour of your body, relieving pressure points, and allowing the spine to align properly. Take pleasure in enjoying all the benefits of a memory foam mattress for a more restful night's sleep. Also includes a free removable and washable zippered mesh topper cover. Breathe new life into your aging mattress and get a comfortable night's sleep by adding the luxuriously designed 3-inch gel memory foam mattress topper. This topper has a ventilated design that increases air flow and reduces body heat. No more tossing and turning and best of all not having to buy a brand new mattress. Latest in Gel Memory Foam Technology Classic Brands uses the latest technology in cool gel memory foam. This next generation of cool gel memory foam is more porous than conventional memory foam making it more breathable and comfortable. The open-celled structure is self-ventilating, so air can travel throughout the material and actually dissipate body heat and regulate body temperature. The Benefits of a Gel Memory Foam Topper There are many benefits of sleeping on a ventilated gel memory foam mattress topper. Not only does the gel memory foam dissipate heat and regulate body temperature so you can sleep more comfortably, the memory foam adjusts to your weight and offers slow conforming response which allows the spine to align properly and ultimately lessens tossing and turning throughout the night. The topper works with your existing mattress to cradle each part of the body evenly and individually and offers luxurious and stress-free support. CertiPUR-US Certified The foam in Classic Brands Decker 10.5-Inch Hybrid Memory Foam and Innerspring Mattress is CertiPUR-US certified. The CertiPUR-US program is a voluntary testing, analysis, and certification program for flexible polyurethane foam used as a cushioning material in home furnishings such as adult mattresses, crib mattresses, upholstered furniture and some accessory comfort products. Certified flexible polyurethane foams have been independently laboratory tested. Classic Brands Smart Packaging Smart packaging reduces the carbon footprint in the manufacturers shipping process. Our advanced packaging technology means we can roll-pack our mattress topper and ship them at one-third of the normal size. Because of this process, we can ship more products per delivery and reduce the amount of carbon emissions. A mattress topper that is roll-packed still retains its initial quality, as each will quickly recover and return to its original shape after being removed out of the packaging. Quality Assurance Look for more innovative specialty sleep products from Classic Brands.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Np1qiFwwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Classic Brands","source_asin":"B08XZ826JN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-734633","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XZ826JN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XZ826JN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
