window.products.push({"id":734724,"name":"Coasters for Drinks Set of 8 with Skull Skeleton Pirate Pattern, Perfect for Halloween Decoration, Absorbent Cork Coasters, Ideal Coffee/Wooden Table ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YXm8cxSjS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfect Cork Material: Each coaster is made of 100% natural authentic cork, natural environmental protection, lightweight, durable and soft, so not easy to damage. It can offer the great heat insulation effect, and also be better at absorbing condensation from glasses, keeps cold and hot drinks from damaging furniture. It is particularly helpful when you drink a large glass of iced tea on hot, humid summer days. The great water absorbing coaster. It is a good choice for daily use. Effective Use: Non-slip & scratch-resistant cork coasters can effectively avoid scratching the marble table or your furniture, and ensure firm place, not slip off the table. Cork coasters for drinks absorbent can prevent tea stains and coffee stains from infiltrating into the desktop. They can also be used as hot pads, put a few cork coasters together for large pots and pans. Very practical, antisepsis and moisture proof. No peculiar smell. Perfect Match And Easy Clean: Each coaster for drinks measures 4 inches in diameter, 0.2 inches in thickness, making it just the right size for all standard cups, mugs, and glasses. Cleaning your new cork coasters is just as easy as using them. Simply rinse the drink coasters in water, wipe with a cloth and they’ll be ready to use again in minutes. Decorative Coasters: Modern and artistic human skull skeleton pirate pattern cool coasters, it is good for kitchen, office, bar, restaurant, home and other occasions, easy to mix and match with any type of decor and home decoration. These unique coasters are also a perfect Halloween decoration to personalize your desktop greatly. Similarly, very suitable for use on housewarming, birthdays, New Years, wedding, holiday, Christmas, Thanksgiving and Anniversary. Drink Coasters Set With Holder: The set includes 8 round cork and a coaster holder. The iron holder is made of black metal, stain resistant and scratch proof, and won't get rusty. You don't need to bear coasters placed everywhere. While not in use, you can neatly stack your coasters in the coaster holder, which will make your home tidier.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YXm8cxSjS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COPLIB","source_asin":"B0965DLV6X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-734724","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0965DLV6X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0965DLV6X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":734725,"name":"Premium Wine Corkscrew Bottle Opener, Wine Shaped Opener - Multifunctional Wine & Beer Cap Openers - Great Funny Gift for Wine Lovers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oF935vulL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FUN WAY TO OPEN BOTTLES 🍷 Crack open your wine bottles with style and humor! Opens both wine corks and beer bottle caps with ease. Once the cork is removed, the corkscrew and lever arm discreetly fold back into the bottle shape design GREAT HOUSEHOLD DECOR 🍷 Sleek and modern bottle design makes this tool perfect for kitchen decor and stylish taste. Leave the lame cork screw openers behind HIGH QUALITY DESIGN 🍷 Corkscrew and prying lever made with stainless steel for long lasting usage. The bottle design of the outsider shell is made of strong ABS plastic to last the test of time SLIM & SLEEK DESIGN 🍷 This wine opener is designed with travel convenience in mind and is easy to slip in a pocket, picnic basket or bring on a road trip BUILT IN MAGNET 🍷 The discreet magnet on the back of the lever allows you to stick this opener on your kitchen fridge or stovetop ABOUT BAYVIEW 🍷 Based in San Francisco, California, we design fun and useful home and kitchen products. We dedicate ourselves to developing quality products that we can share with our community. Join the following of happy BayView customers!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oF935vulL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BAYVIEW","source_asin":"B08SCHYN55","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-734725","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SCHYN55","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SCHYN55","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
