window.products.push({"id":734802,"name":"Ganxin 5 Inch 6-Digit LED Race Timing Clock, Running Event Gym Timer Clock for Countdown/Count Up,12/24 Hour Real Time Clock, Stopwatch with Remote Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AkPLdFlYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What's the Specification Details? Clock dimension: 27.1''L x 7.4''H x 1.6''W (69cm L x 19cm H x 4cm W)  Housing material: aluminum alloy  Digits height & color: 5-inch (12.7 cm), in red color  Light source:LED (high brightness, long life-span)  Power supply: 12V DC (110-260VAC power supply)Approval:CE & RoHS What's the Main Functions? How to make setting & use? (For advanced editable-settings, please refer to the user manual) 12/24H Real-time clock: format [HH:MM:SS], press [7] for clock mode, press[Edit] to enter current time, then press[Enter] to save and start, press button [4] to convert 12/24 hour formats. Countdown/up: format [HH:MM:SS], press [Timer 1] “DOWN arrow” for countdown mode, press [Edit] to fill in with wanted time, press [Enter] to save, press [Start] to begin, press [setup] to cease if needed. Press [reset] to restart. For count-up, press [Timer1] “UP arrow” firstly, and then follow the same. Stopwatch: format [MM:SS:MS], press [Timer 2] “DOWN arrow” for stopwatch countdown mode, press [Edit] to fill in with wanted time to begin, press [Enter] to save, press [Start] to begin, press [setup] to cease if needed. It can be stopped & restart at anytime. Press [reset] to restart. For count-up, press [Timer 2] “UP arrow” firstly, and then follow the same. What's Included in the Package? <1> LED clock: 1 PC <2> Adapter: 1 PC <3> IR remote controller: 1 PC <4> Instruction manual: 1 PC <5>Wall bracket:1 SET Important Cautions: The controller does NOT have AAA battery, because battery is NOT accepted by Air courier, thanks for your kind understanding.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AkPLdFlYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GAN XIN","source_asin":"B0928KDM6H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-734802","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0928KDM6H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0928KDM6H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
