window.products.push({"id":734865,"name":"Z-Access 3D Display Frame 6 by 4-Inch Stand Alone Frame, Mocha","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ER5PfP8hL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Z-Access 3D Display Frame is the unique and interactive way to prominently display and protect 3 dimensional memorabilia, such as keepsakes, art, crafts, sports memorabilia, heirlooms and treasured personal items that are currently out of sight and tucked away because you just can’t figure out how to display them. Unlike a shadowbox, acrylic case, or picture frame, the Z-Access 3D Display frame uses a soft proprietary film that gently stretches over your treasured item and securely holds it in place. The clear, elastic, tear resistant film is completely inert, which allows you to place your most sensitive items in our display frame, all the while protecting your personal treasure. Imagine being able to feel the actual strings on a Babe Ruth Homerun ball without damaging the ball - try that with an acrylic case. Or picture your children being able to safely feel the contour and grit of your grandfather’s WWII medals, their smiles of pride at being able to touch those cherished items, instead of just looking at them behind a sanitary, lifeless piece of glass. The film is UV resistant, completely acid free, and will not transfer anything to, or take anything away from the object that it protects and displays. The film does not stick to the displayed object but it does have a grip which allows for easy loading and lets you position your item in all sorts of cool and different angles for optimal visual value. The Z-Access display frame will accommodate almost any object as long as it fits within its’ 6-inch x 4-inch footprint, and can securely hold objects up to 3 pounds. Z-Access Display Frames are a truly revolutionary way to showcase and display your most treasured memories. Start unpacking all of those valuable collectibles and cherished memorabilia and display them in 3D.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ER5PfP8hL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Z-Access","source_asin":"B0077FWPIG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-734865","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0077FWPIG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0077FWPIG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":734866,"name":"Luxury Faux Fur Reversible Throw Blanket Queen Size 86\" x 94\", Extra Soft & Warm Solid & Animal Prints Fuzzy Lightweight Shaggy Softest Blankets, Hypo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xqGDiQJ9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Vaiza Blankets - High Qaulity Fluffy & Cozy Luxury Blankets that will give you warmth and comfort all year long! SUPER SOFT AND COZY: Get warm and cozy with the softest blanket in the world. Vaiza blankets are luxurious faux fur blankets that are perfect for snuggling up on the couch as a throw blanket, in bed, or having wrapped around you in front of the fireplace, or as you watch a movie. This lush blanket is unlike any other blanket. Suitable for fall/autumn, winter, and spring. LUXURIOUS FEEL WITH ELEGANT STYLE: In addition to being the softest blanket in the world, it’s beautiful reversible design makes it a beautiful throw and blanket that elevates the interior design of any space. Choose between the black throw blanket, grey throw blanket, and brown throw blanket offered in our first collection called Vaiza. VERSATILE USAGES: The Vaiza blanket has unlimited versatile uses. Great for gifts, using as a throw blanket on your couch, or a faux fur comforter, bed blanket, outdoors, camping, sleepovers, perfect for laying on carpet or hardwood floor for crawling babies, also works great as both a dog blanket and cat blanket for your furry family members to enjoy. MACHINE WASHABLE & EASY TO CARE: It couldn’t be easier. Machine wash your Vaiza blanket on gentle with cold water, tumble dry on low. No shedding & no pilling. Please do not use a softener. 100% SATISFACTION SERVICE: Experience unmatched softness and coziness with your Vaiza blanket. We are very sure you will fall in love with this soft shaggy blanket, but for some reason if you are not happy with this product, just return it for a full refund. We are committed to your shopping experience, please feel free to contact us with any questions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xqGDiQJ9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SOFTY","source_asin":"B08HSSMW6R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-734866","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HSSMW6R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HSSMW6R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":734867,"name":"Kidsilk Haze Stripe, California Sunrise 356","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711RbEG1DcL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"One of the most recent additions to the Kidsilk family, Kidsilk Haze Stripe is a colorful adaptation of the ever-popular original, Kidsilk Haze. Master of Color Creation, Kaffe Fassett, designed a bold palette of luscious self-striping colorways worthy of this beloved Rowan yarn. Each 50g ball has 460 yards of delicious mohair and silk (twice as much as the original Haze which comes in 25g skeins) making color continuity a breeze for larger projects. We couldn't be more excited about this luxurious laceweight yarn as it is ideal for sheer, gauzy fabrics and the rich colorways add prismatic beauty to any project.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711RbEG1DcL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rowan","source_asin":"B0090QXYOY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-734867","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0090QXYOY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0090QXYOY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
