window.products.push({"id":734905,"name":"River City Clocks Call Cuckoo Clock with Hand Carved Quarter Five Leaves and One Bird","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ObX59EN+L._AC_.jpg","description":"River City quarter call cuckoo clocks will add charm to any room in your home. At every quarter hour (ie: 9:00, 9:15, 9:30, 9:45) the cuckoo bird will come out and emit a short \"cuc\" instead of a full \"cuckoo.\" The clocks need to be wound once per day by pulling a single chain that raises the pinecone weight. This clock features five leaves and one bird which are hand-carved in the Black forest of Germany. Please note that this clock does not have a silent mode or night shut off. Great effort has been made to portray each cuckoo clock as accurately as possible. As with many handmade items, the exact coloration and carving may vary slightly from clock to clock. We consider this to be a special part of their character. This clock is covered by a two year limited warranty covering workmanship and manufacturers defects.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ObX59EN+L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"River City Clocks","source_asin":"B009FX5IH8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-734905","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009FX5IH8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009FX5IH8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
