window.products.push({"id":734925,"name":"CCINEE 20 Cavity Silicone Cake Pop Mold with 30 pcs of Clear Cellophane Treat Bags 20 pcs Lollipop Sticks and 30 pcs Twist Ties in 6 Colors for Cake P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.48,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OOV4N5bdL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"PRODUCT FEATURES: ★Premium food grade silicone material ★100% BPA free ★Non-stick, easy to clean ★Durable and ultra flexibile ★Dishwater-safe, oven-safe and refrigerator-safe ★Heat resistant to -40°F - 446°F WHY DO YOU CHOOSE \"DECORA\" PRODUCT? ★Pop Cakes are fun to make - the kids will love decorating them and they are really tasty to eat. ★Making cake pops is so easy with this! You will much prefer this mould than using the cake pop machines. ★The thicker material that we're using right now also helps resist milling, can be used again and again. ★The mould is easy to fill, easy to empty, easy to clean. USAGE: ★Put all ingredients into a mixer and cream together until well combined and pale in colour. Use a teaspoon and fill each pod with mixture so that each pod is full and a little domed. Put the top on the maker and cook at 190 for around 15-20 minutes. Push a cake tester through the holes to ensure they are cooked. Leave to cool and then pop out of the mould! FRIENDLY TIPS: ★No exposure to fire ★No tools scratch ★ As long as you completely fill the bottom half of the mould you get just about perfect cake pops。 It is great that you are able to make so many at the same time! ★ The first time you go to use this product, it is recommended to use toothpaste to clean, then wash with boiling water, and soak for two hours and dry in the air! ★__________________________________________________________★","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OOV4N5bdL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CCINEE","source_asin":"B07B3SWD82","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-734925","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B3SWD82","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07B3SWD82","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
