window.products.push({"id":734943,"name":"Baker Auntie 2-Pack Cake Collar Rolls - 6\" x 552\" Acetate Sheets for Baking - 30 Stickers - Clear Acetate Strips for Chocolate Mousse – Transparent Mo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QN1EFaStL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔ [ GET YOUR CAKE IN SHAPE! ] – The Baker Auntie acetate cake collar rolls are new in the kitchen & ready to roll! The acetate sheets are an ideal way to mold your cake to the perfect shape. The 2-pack 6 x 552 inch rolls are thick, transparent, and offer the perfect pack size for any amateur or advanced baker. The acetate strips can be used for baking mousse, cheesecake, chocolate, cake decorations, and mostly every dessert or pastry that you can think of. 😊 ✔ [ FULL KIT FOR A HOME BAKER ] The Baker Auntie 14 meters long, 15 cm tall clear acetate sheets for baking come together with a bonus 30-pack stickers. The transparent small and thin tapes hold the plastic collar tight around the cake. The acetate film is long enough to wrap around more than 15 cakes, while 2 stickers are just enough for decorating a cake with a one-meter-long roll of acetate. ✔ [ EASY TO APPLY ] The 100% transparent cake ring acetate strips take no more than 5 minutes to install. 1. Measure the size of the cake; 2. Cut the collar band to size; 3. Apply sticker/s; 4. Voila! We have a new pastry chef in town! Please note: even if it is high heat resistant at up to 60C, our recommendation is to keep it away from the oven for a safe cooking process. ✔ [ COOK AS A PASTRY CHEF ] Every home baker deserves high-quality large acetate sheets. Easily bake the cake in any form you want: round or square with the 100 microns soft Baker Auntie cake surrounding edge. The home bakery has never been easier, hasn’t it? 😊 ✔ [ 100% MONEY BACK GUARANTEE ] We’re dedicated to offering the best products to help you bake in the comfort of your home. We made sure the cake collar acetate sheets meet the highest standards of quality but if for ANY reason you are not satisfied, you will receive a refund, no questions asked. Click on the \"Add to Cart\" button NOW and get this amazing new product!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QN1EFaStL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baker Auntie","source_asin":"B098V11GDL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-734943","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098V11GDL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098V11GDL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
