window.products.push({"id":734985,"name":"LEGO Kids' 9002298 Belville Mini-Figure Alarm Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514pNB9dFWL._AC_SL1075_.jpg","description":"Product description From the LEGO® Collection. LEGO Classic Girl Minifigure Table Clock. The perfect gift for any girl that likes to \"play well.\" Always know when it's time to play dress up with this pink girl full sized alarm clock! Poseable LEGO minifigure features a digital LCD screen display with backlight, snooze indicator and alarm setting. Push down on the head for an easy to find snooze button or to light up the display. Includes 2 AAA batteries and instructions. Measures 9.5\" tall. CHOKING HAZARD -- SMALL PARTS. Not for children under 3 years of age.The name 'LEGO' is an abbreviation of the two Danish words \"leg godt,\" meaning \"play well.\" The LEGO® Group was founded in 1932 by Ole Kirk Kristiansen. The company has passed from father to son and is now owned by Kjeld Kirk Kristiansen, a grandchild of the founder. It has come a long way over the past almost 80 years -- from a small carpenter's workshop to a modern, global enterprise that is now, in terms of sales, the world's fifth-largest manufacturer of toys.LEGO, the LEGO® logo, DUPLO, BIONICLE, MINDSTORMS, the BELVILLE, KNIGHTS' KINGDOM and EXO-FORCE logos, the Brick and Knob configurations and the Minifigure are trademarks of the LEGO® Group. © 2011 The LEGO® Group. All rights reserved. Amazon.com The Belville Minifigure Clock is a must have accessory! Built to Legos high standards and designed with even the most demanding Belville fans in mind. This clock will be wanted by fans and non-fans alike! Featuring an alarm and snooze button, this clock is not only pretty but functional as well. This clock is a must have! The LEGO Story The name ‘LEGO’ is an abbreviation of the two Danish words “leg godt”, meaning “play well”. It’s our name and it’s our ideal. The LEGO Group was founded in 1932 by Ole Kirk Christiansen. The Company has passed from father to son and remains a family owned business even today: Owned by Kjeld Kirk Kristiansen, a grandchild of the founder. It has come a long way over the past almost 80 years – from a small carpenter’s workshop to a modern, global enterprise. The LEGO Group is a privately held company based in Billund, Denmark. The company is still owned by the Kirk Kristiansen family who founded it in 1932. The LEGO Group is engaged in the development of children’s creativity through playing and learning and it is this core philosophy that is built into every LEGO brand watch and clock. See more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514pNB9dFWL._AC_SL1075_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LEGO","source_asin":"B003M2E14E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-734985","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003M2E14E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003M2E14E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
